---
title: "enable_realtime_publication (0002: Enable Realtime for Attendance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_pub: check supabase_realtime publication exists
    q_check_pub --> q_add_table: publication exists
    q_check_pub --> q_error: publication missing
    q_add_table --> q_validate: ALTER PUBLICATION supabase_realtime ADD TABLE attendance.temp_registrations
    q_validate --> [*]: table added to realtime publication
    q_error --> [*]: revert "publication not found"

    note right of q_add_table
        INV-001: attendance.temp_registrations must exist before adding to publication
        INV-002: supabase_realtime publication must exist before ALTER
        INV-003: table is not already a member of the publication (idempotency risk)
    end note

    note right of q_validate
        INV-004: after execution, all INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on attendance.temp_registrations are broadcast via Realtime
        INV-005: no row-level security filter is applied to Realtime events by default (data exposure risk)
    end note
